{"id":138957999879593,"name":"Sky Pushers [SQUID GAME 3]","desc":"💥Welcome to Sky Pushers [SQUID GAME 3]\n\nStep onto the platforms and push your way to victory. Square, Triangle, Circle — only one will win.\n\n🏆 Last player standing wins\n⚔️ Push players off platforms\n🎯 Fight for the pole each round\n☁️ High-stakes battles in the sky\n\nCan you survive the Sky Squid Game?\n\n👍 Like & favorite the game for more!\n🔔 Follow us to get notified about updates!\n\nTags: Squid Game, Squid Game Season 3, Knives and Keys, Red Light Green Light, Jump Rope, Push, Survival","path":"/game/138957999879593-sky-pushers","slug":"138957999879593-sky-pushers","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f5844eecb1b72f240b0e44984617823098ffe5e87a25a1dd66c2a5d6a627e767.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-76c6b36bf34008f8fafcda1c61398bae/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":57,"visitor":43843725,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-21T00:08:42.094Z","creator":{"name":"Sky Peak Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Sky-Pushers-SQUID-GAME-3-Simple-Anti-Fall-49439","_id":"68a6638a5165138168ed0dfb","title":"Simple Anti Fall","game":{"_id":"68a6638a5165138168ed0df8","gameId":138957999879593,"name":"Sky Pushers [SQUID GAME 3]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":138957999879593},"features":"Enjoy:)","tags":[],"script":"local partName = \"Hehwu6s7wh2hw8q8w672j1hqa67shgdjwk$#4171#&@72hwk\"\n\nlocal function createPlatform()\n    local corner1 = Vector3.new(237.12, 132, 39.02) \n    local corner2 = Vector3.new(-264.34, 132, -186.48) \n\n    local center = (corner1 + corner2) / 2\n    center = center + Vector3.new(0, 5, 0)\n\n    local size = Vector3.new(\n        math.abs(corner1.X - corner2.X),\n        2,\n        math.abs(corner1.Z - corner2.Z)\n    )\n\n    local part = Instance.new(\"Part\")\n    part.Size = size\n    part.Position = center\n    part.Anchored = true\n    part.CanCollide = true\n    part.Transparency = 0.99\n    part.Color = Color3.fromRGB(0, 0, 0)\n    part.Name = partName\n    part.Parent = workspace\nend\n\nif not workspace:FindFirstChild(partName) then\n    createPlatform()\nend\n\nwhile task.wait(15) do\n    if not workspace:FindFirstChild(partName) then\n        createPlatform()\n    end\nend","owner":{"_id":"660e43bf29c1b3cba3e41200","username":"BopIsme","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e6ef97b6c6867e90b6a43d475e9857ba36a42c5ff74049dad4028ea17ef7960f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/660e43bf29c1b3cba3e41200-1749703148654.jpeg"},"status":"offline","id":"660e43bf29c1b3cba3e41200","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":1000000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e6ef97b6c6867e90b6a43d475e9857ba36a42c5ff74049dad4028ea17ef7960f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/660e43bf29c1b3cba3e41200-1749703148654.jpeg"}},"verified":false,"views":4793,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-808ef990681c28dd725f596dce0c5419-40ec8b53d2a8.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-808ef990681c28dd725f596dce0c5419-40ec8b53d2a8.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-08-21T00:08:42.096Z","executes":384,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-18T02:12:33.834Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-808ef990681c28dd725f596dce0c5419-40ec8b53d2a8.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-808